  "resume": "This is a Swiss TV news broadcast from the Tagesschau series dated 31 August 1977, featuring a segment on dental hygiene produced by the University of Zurich's dental institute. It shows dental professionals demonstrating proper flossing techniques and includes statements from institute director Thomas Marthaler alongside graphics illustrating childhood and adult tooth decay. The segment promotes healthy eating habits by displaying nutritious foods like fruit and cheese."
